<title>RUSSIA: Russia Nov industry output falls 5.8 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Russia Nov industry output falls 5.8 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian industrial production in November was 5.8 percent lower than in October, Interfax news agency quoted the State Statistics Committee as saying on Saturday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	NOV 96    OCT 96    NOV 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	-5.8	  +7	 -3.8</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	   N/A	  -4	 -5.5</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
